{"id":"a0a00ecd601e0096","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-forcing10-kappa-distributive-poset.md","title":"ZFC Forcing10 Kappa Distributive Poset","display":"df-zfc-forcing10-kappa-distributive-poset — ZFC Forcing10 Kappa Distributive Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-kappa-distributive-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing10-kappa-distributive-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing10-kappa-distributive-poset — ZFC Forcing10 Kappa Distributive Poset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-kappa-distributive-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing10-kappa-distributive-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing10-kappa-distributive-poset — ZFC Forcing10 Kappa Distributive Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (forcing poset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\">\\(\\leq_P\\)</span> (forcing order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_P\">\\(1_P\\)</span> (top condition)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (distributivity cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\">\\(\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\)</span> (length of a dense-open family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec D:\\lambda\\to\\mathcal P(P)\">\\(\\vec D:\\lambda\\to\\mathcal P(P)\\)</span> (dense-open family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\)</span> (forcing-poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10KappaDistributivePoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10KappaDistributivePoset}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10KappaDistributivePoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall\\vec D:\\lambda\\to\\mathcal P(P)\\;\\Bigl(\\forall\\xi\\in\\lambda\\;\\bigl[(\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in\\vec D(\\xi)\\;(q\\leq_Pp))\\land\\forall p\\in\\vec D(\\xi)\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;(q\\leq_Pp\\to q\\in\\vec D(\\xi))\\bigr]\\to\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in P\\;\\bigl(q\\leq_Pp\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\lambda\\;(q\\in\\vec D(\\xi))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10KappaDistributivePoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall\\vec D:\\lambda\\to\\mathcal P(P)\\;\\Bigl(\\forall\\xi\\in\\lambda\\;\\bigl[(\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in\\vec D(\\xi)\\;(q\\leq_Pp))\\land\\forall p\\in\\vec D(\\xi)\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;(q\\leq_Pp\\to q\\in\\vec D(\\xi))\\bigr]\\to\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in P\\;\\bigl(q\\leq_Pp\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\lambda\\;(q\\in\\vec D(\\xi))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the dense-open intersection characterization of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-distributivity. The conclusion uses pointwise membership, so the empty family correctly has intersection <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> rather than an undefined empty indexed intersection.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"targe